"tag"},{"para":{"x":640,"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","trans":true,"addImg":"chara055_1_face_chara055_1b","noOut":false,"y":-290,"bright":0.6,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara055_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"小孩们","text":"[show]知道了！迦南姐姐再见！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_54"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"x":640,"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","trans":true,"addImg":"chara055_1_face_chara055_1b","noOut":false,"y":-290,"bright":1,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara055_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"迦南","text":"[show]掌炉者阁下，麻烦你给他们讲讲现在的情况吧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_77"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"x":640,"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","trans":true,"addImg":"chara055_1_face_chara055_1b","noOut":false,"y":-290,"bright":0.6,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara055_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]好，那我就从头说起吧。其实，黑铁锻炉之所以能够在这秋日荒野发展起来，主要是因为两块宝地。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_78"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]其一，是西边的蛇腹矿坑。那里不止产煤，还出产一种稀有的[color=ffb64d]蛇铁矿[colorEnd]，是黑铁锻炉的重要特产。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_79"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]其二，是北边的[color=ffb64d]磨牙溪谷[colorEnd]，那里的溪水富含魔素，在淬火时能够极大地提升铁料的韧性，让装备的强度几乎接近[color=ffb64d]附魔装备[colorEnd]。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_80"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]正是因为有了这两个条件，黑铁锻炉才能成为驿站最重要的装备产地。[r]但现在，这两个地方都已经不在我们的掌控之中……[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_81","text":"这两个宝地是怎么丢的？"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_81"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[cm][show]我们没有那么多兵力可以派出去防守，所以这两个地方不是[color=ffb64d]丢了[colorEnd]，而是被我们[color=ffb64d]放弃了[colorEnd]。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_82"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]但那毕竟是无奈之举，现在我们胜利了，要恢复生产，就必须把这两个地方拿回来。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_83"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"x":640,"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","trans":true,"addImg":"chara055_1_face_chara055_1b","noOut":false,"y":-290,"bright":1,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara055_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"迦南","text":"[show]就像掌炉者所说的那样，这两个地方对于黑铁锻炉来说至关重要，必须尽快将它们收回到掌控之中。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_84"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"迦南","text":"[show]但是这种关键要地，本身非常隐秘，除了必要人员之外，最好还是不要让多余的人知道。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_85"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"迦南","text":"[show]所以最终，这两个任务就落到了我们头上。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_86"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"迦南","text":"[show]蛇腹矿坑那边由我去，而磨牙溪谷那边则由你们来解决，[r]其余契约者小队就去处理那些不太需要保密的地方。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_87"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"迦南","text":"[show]这个安排你们感觉如何？[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_88","text":"明白了。我们立刻前往磨牙溪谷。"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_88"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"x":640,"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","trans":true,"addImg":"chara055_1_face_chara055_1b","noOut":false,"y":-290,"bright":0.6,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara055_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"x":50,"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","trans":true,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","noOut":false,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm